### =========================
### 🔐 AUTH FLOW (SIMPLU)
### =========================

### Register USER
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "User Test",
  "email": "user@test.com",
  "password": "1234",
  "role": "USER"
}

###

### Register TRAINER
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Trainer Test",
  "email": "trainer@test.com",
  "password": "1234",
  "role": "TRAINER"
}

###

### Login USER
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@test.com",
  "password": "1234"
}

> {% client.global.set("user_token", response.body.token); %}

###

### Login TRAINER
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "trainer@test.com",
  "password": "1234"
}

> {% client.global.set("trainer_token", response.body.token); %}

### =========================
### 🧪 TEST SECURITY
### =========================

### No token (should fail)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workouts

###

### USER token
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workouts
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

###

### TRAINER token
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workouts
Authorization: Bearer {{trainer_token}}

### =========================
### 💪 WORKOUTS
### =========================

### Create workout (TRAINER only)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workouts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{trainer_token}}

{
  "name": "Push Day",
  "description": "Chest + Triceps"
}

###

### Get workouts
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workouts
Authorization: Bearer {{trainer_token}}

### =========================
### 🧍 USER WORKOUTS
### =========================

### Assign workout to user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/user-workouts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

{
  "userId": 7,
  "workoutId": 3,
  "date": "2026-04-01"
}

###

### Get user workouts
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/user-workouts
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}